                      <paragraph eId="schedule-2__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__part-XID__sec-135Y__subsec-2__para-b">
                        <num>b</num>
                        <content>
                          <p>the reference in that method statement to $30,000 was instead a reference to $31,177.</p>
